# Drizzle migrations for Payload CMS collections.
#
# Migrations are generated with:  npx payload migrate:create <name>
# Migrations are applied with:    npx payload migrate   (set DATABASE_URL to DIRECT_URL: port 5432)
#
# NOTE: The Payload CLI (`npx payload ...`) requires Node 20 LTS or Node 26+. On Node 24.x the
# CLI fails with an undici `CacheStorage: Illegal constructor` error (tsx symbol-dedup bug).
# If you are on Node 24, bootstrap the schema instead via the PAYLOAD_DB_PUSH=true env var +
# `next dev` (see SUPABASE-SETUP.md → "Node 24 fallback"). Then generate migrations on Node 20.
